Package: mcsimr
Title: Local Monte Carlo Simulation Workbench
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcus", "Harris", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Marcus Harris
Maintainer: Marcus Harris <maintainer@example.com>
Description: A local-first R package and Shiny app foundation for designing,
    running, checkpointing, summarizing, and exporting reproducible Monte Carlo
    simulation studies. The engine supports ordinary least squares regression
    and structural equation model simulations through lavaan, including
    condition grids for sample sizes, estimators, and population parameters.
